{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e5497295-f886-8bd0-8f2a-1d7bd5a6a75e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T18:26:16-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniel Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:24:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:24:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. [pause] Sorry, I'm keeping my voice down. Somebody's sleeping. I know it's after hours, I'm calling the storm line since City Hall's closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:24:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, that's what this line is for. Go ahead, what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:24:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a tree down across my mother's driveway. From the wind, last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. We can't get the car out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:24:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a tree across the driveway. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:24:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "454 Rhode Island Avenue. Historic Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:24:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four fifty-four Rhode Island Avenue. Got it. Is the tree on her property, or did it come down from somewhere else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] ...ours, I think. Big limb and part of the trunk. It's in the yard, but it's lying across the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:25:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I lost you for a second. You said it's in her yard, across the driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:25:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. In the yard. Across the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:25:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Are there any wires on it or touching it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No wires. I looked. Nothing hanging."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:25:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Then if it's on private property, the owner is generally responsible for clearing it, so she'd need a tree service. The city handles trees in the street or on city property. If wires were involved, that would be the utility."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:25:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So who do I call, then? To report it. Is there a place to report a downed tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:25:38-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For a city tree or one blocking the road, you call us, here, and we send a crew. For yours, a private tree company. If part of it is hanging over the sidewalk or street, tell me and I'll put in a report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:25:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[inaudible] ...no, it's just the driveway. Okay. That's what I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:25:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want me to note it anyway, with a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:26:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0189."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:26:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-nine. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:26:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. I have to go, I'm on my way to get a flu shot before they close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T18:26:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Take care."
    }
  ],
